184
00:03:07,259 --> 00:03:08,037
which stays fine in

185
00:03:08,037 --> 00:03:09,148
the pantry.

186
00:03:09,148 --> 00:03:10,333
Spread it on crackers,

187
00:03:10,333 --> 00:03:10,815
eat it with a

188
00:03:10,815 --> 00:03:11,481
spoon,

189
00:03:11,481 --> 00:03:12,148
or put it on

190
00:03:12,148 --> 00:03:12,889
