195
00:03:18,889 --> 00:03:19,630
Unopened,

196
00:03:19,630 --> 00:03:20,815
crackers keep about eight

197
00:03:20,815 --> 00:03:21,630
months.

198
00:03:21,630 --> 00:03:22,519
Once opened,

199
