294
00:05:02,765 --> 00:05:03,432
With a box of

295
00:05:03,432 --> 00:05:04,395
shelf-stable milk from

296
00:05:04,395 --> 00:05:05,284
number three,

297
00:05:05,284 --> 00:05:06,358
it's a familiar breakfast

298
00:05:06,358 --> 00:05:06,987
