309
00:05:17,210 --> 00:05:18,284
Fold the inner bag

310
00:05:18,284 --> 00:05:19,543
down tight.

311
00:05:19,543 --> 00:05:20,765
Plain cereal and granola

312
00:05:20,765 --> 00:05:21,580
also work as a

313
00:05:21,580 --> 00:05:22,469
snack straight from the

314
00:05:22,469 --> 00:05:23,543
box.

315
00:05:23,543 --> 00:05:24,913
Number six is dried

316
00:05:24,913 --> 00:05:25,728
fruit.

317
00:05:25,728 --> 00:05:26,506
Raisins,

318
00:05:26,506 --> 00:05:27,284
apricots,

319
00:05:27,284 --> 00:05:29,432
prunes and dried cranberries.

320
00:05:29,432 --> 00:05:30,172
In an outage,

321
00:05:30,172 --> 00:05:31,284
