329
00:05:38,172 --> 00:05:38,765
Unopened,

330
00:05:38,765 --> 00:05:39,728
it keeps about six

331
00:05:39,728 --> 00:05:40,987
months in the pantry.

332
00:05:40,987 --> 00:05:41,839
Once opened,

333
00:05:41,839 --> 00:05:42,691
about a month,

334
00:05:42,691 --> 00:05:43,580
or longer if it's

335
00:05:43,580 --> 00:05:44,802
