339
00:05:47,284 --> 00:05:48,024
mix.

340
00:05:48,172 --> 00:05:50,098
Number seven is nuts.

341
00:05:50,098 --> 00:05:50,691
They're one of the

342
00:05:50,691 --> 00:05:51,913
