351
00:06:01,098 --> 00:06:01,765
because of the oil

352
00:06:01,765 --> 00:06:02,468
in them.

353
00:06:02,691 --> 00:06:03,839
In a regular bag,

354
00:06:03,839 --> 00:06:04,839
North Dakota State gives

355
00:06:04,839 --> 00:06:06,024
them about three months

356
00:06:06,024 --> 00:06:06,987
unopened.

357
00:06:06,987 --> 00:06:08,469
In a vacuum-sealed can,

358
00:06:08,469 --> 00:06:09,358
about a year.

359
00:06:09,358 --> 00:06:10,395
So for the outage

360
00:06:10,395 --> 00:06:11,135
shelf,

361
00:06:11,135 --> 00:06:12,247
