381
00:06:33,950 --> 00:06:35,210
refrigerator.

382
00:06:35,210 --> 00:06:36,210
Fruit cups also give

383
00:06:36,210 --> 00:06:37,098
you some liquid,

384
00:06:37,098 --> 00:06:37,950
which helps when water

385
00:06:37,950 --> 00:06:39,024
is limited.

386
00:06:39,024 --> 00:06:39,913
Choose the ones packed

387
00:06:39,913 --> 00:06:40,691
