00:06:46,987 --> 00:06:47,728
No plate,

394
00:06:47,728 --> 00:06:48,691
no spoon,

395
00:06:48,691 --> 00:06:49,580
nothing to open but

396
00:06:49,580 --> 00:06:50,654
a wrapper.

397
00:06:50,654 --> 00:06:51,210
Keep a box in

398
00:06:51,210 --> 00:06:52,024
the pantry and a

399
00:06:52,024 --> 00:06:53,098
few in your car,

400
00:06:53,098 --> 00:06:54,247
because winter storms don't

401
00:06:54,247 --> 00:06:54,987
