402
00:06:54,987 --> 00:06:55,913
home.

403
00:06:55,913 --> 00:06:56,765
Check the dates.

404
00:06:56,765 --> 00:06:58,321
They don't last forever.

405
00:06:58,321 --> 00:06:59,284
Rotate them into lunch

406
00:06:59,284 --> 00:06:59,765
boxes,

407
00:06:59,765 --> 00:07:00,469
and replace them as

408
00:07:00,469 --> 00:07:01,247
