409
00:07:01,247 --> 00:07:02,210
And number ten is

410
00:07:02,210 --> 00:07:04,098
a little comfort food.

411
00:07:04,098 --> 00:07:04,617
Cookies,

412
00:07:04,617 --> 00:07:05,284
chocolate,

413
00:07:05,284 --> 00:07:06,284
hard candy,

414
00:07:06,284 --> 00:07:06,839
or a box of

415
00:07:06,839 --> 00:07:07,728
the cereal the kids

416
00:07:07,728 --> 00:07:08,580
love.

417
00:07:08,580 --> 00:07:09,876
This isn't a joke.

418
00:07:09,876 --> 00:07:11,358
Emergency planners recommend

419
00:07:11,358 --> 00:07:12,506
keeping some comfort food

420
00:07:12,506 --> 00:07:13,950
