421
00:07:13,950 --> 00:07:14,765
because a long,

422
00:07:14,765 --> 00:07:15,284
cold,

423
00:07:15,284 --> 00:07:16,432
dark day is hard

424
00:07:16,432 --> 00:07:17,481
on everyone,

425
00:07:17,481 --> 00:07:18,469
