429
00:07:22,321 --> 00:07:23,358
Packaged cookies about

430
00:07:23,358 --> 00:07:24,024
two months,

431
00:07:24,024 --> 00:07:25,432
so rotate those.

432
00:07:25,432 --> 00:07:26,272
Keep it small,

433
00:07:26,272 --> 00:07:26,839
and save it for

434
00:07:26,839 --> 00:07:27,728
the second or third

435
00:07:27,728 --> 00:07:28,172
day,

436
00:07:28,172 --> 00:07:29,061
when everyone needs it

437
00:07:29,061 --> 00:07:30,024
most.

438
00:07:30,124 --> 00:07:30,939
Before we get to

439
00:07:30,939 --> 00:07:31,754
supplies,

440
00:07:31,754 --> 00:07:32,902
here's what doesn't belong

441
00:07:32,902 --> 00:07:33,865
on this shelf,

442
00:07:33,865 --> 00:07:34,605
even though it's in

443
00:07:34,605 --> 00:07:36,087
