486
00:08:22,346 --> 00:08:23,457
for drinking and basic

487
00:08:23,457 --> 00:08:24,161
cleaning,

488
00:08:24,161 --> 00:08:25,087
and enough for several

489
00:08:25,087 --> 00:08:25,828
days.

490
00:08:25,828 --> 00:08:26,643
Keep it in sealed

491
00:08:26,643 --> 00:08:28,013
bottles or jugs.

492
00:08:28,013 --> 00:08:28,605
And if you filled

493
00:08:28,605 --> 00:08:29,383
the empty space in

494
00:08:29,383 --> 00:08:30,346
your freezer with water

495
00:08:30,346 --> 00:08:30,865
bottles,

496
00:08:30,865 --> 00:08:31,420
like I showed you

497
00:08:31,420 --> 00:08:32,643
in the freezer video,

498
00:08:32,643 --> 00:08:33,754
those keep the freezer

499
00:08:33,754 --> 00:08:34,902
