511
00:08:45,272 --> 00:08:45,902
With one,

512
00:08:45,902 --> 00:08:46,902
the canned beans,

513
00:08:46,902 --> 00:08:47,902
chili and fruit from

514
00:08:47,902 --> 00:08:49,124
my canned-food video work

515
00:08:49,124 --> 00:08:49,828
here too,

516
00:08:49,828 --> 00:08:50,346
as long as you're

517
00:08:50,346 --> 00:08:51,013
happy to eat them

518
