527
00:08:59,865 --> 00:09:00,568
more of.

528
00:09:00,568 --> 00:09:01,605
Keep salty snacks to

529
00:09:01,605 --> 00:09:02,494
a minimum on this

530
00:09:02,494 --> 00:09:03,346
shelf.

531
00:09:03,346 --> 00:09:04,346
And fourth,

532
00:09:04,346 --> 00:09:05,902
